che.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/7920727c-4e7d-496a-9223-d9c6673e9e53.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "winson-create-skill", "ownerName": "user_add7f3d3", "score": 13960.11396011396, "slug": "winson-create-skill", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780496253782, "version": "1.0.3"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779714520870, "description": "Create new skills using multi-agent collaboration, modify and improve existing skills, and measure skill performance. Use when users want to create a skill from scratch, edit, or optimize an existing skill, run evals to test a skill, benchmark skill performance with variance analysis, or optimize a skill's description for better triggering accuracy. When creating skills, use multiple agents in parallel: researcher for analysis, developer for implementation, tester for validation, and reviewer for quality assessment.", "description_zh": "Create new skills using multi-agent collaboration, modify and improve existing skills, and measure skill performance. Use when users want to create a skill from scratch, edit, or optimize an existing skill, run evals to test a skill, benchmark skill performance with variance analysis, or optimize a skill's description for better triggering accuracy. When creating skills, use multiple agents in parallel: researcher for analysis, developer for implementation, tester for validation, and reviewer for quality assessment.", "downloads": 49, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_31070f98/multi-agent-skill-creator", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/27205dc2-3c4b-4854-85b1-8902f05745a3.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "multi-agent-skill-creator", "ownerName": "user_31070f98", "score": 5638.665132336018, "slug": "multi-agent-skill-creator", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780496218252, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1778811628649, "description": "在代码提交 git 前，通过 git diff 对比修改内容，逐文件审查变更点，检测潜在 BUG、隐含风险与可优化项，输出结构化审查报告。当用户表达提交前检查、提交检查、commit 前检查、pre-commit review、提前审查代码、检查一下改动、看看能不能提交等意图时使用此技能。注意：此技能与「代码评审」不同——代码评审在开发完成后结合需求文档与概要设计进行完整度审查，提交前检查是轻量级的基于 git diff 的代码质量把关。", "description_zh": "在代码提交 git 前，通过 git diff 对比修改内容，逐文件审查变更点，检测潜在 BUG、隐含风险与可优化项，输出结构化审查报告。当用户表达提交前检查、提交检查、commit 前检查、pre-commit review、提前审查代码、检查一下改动、看看能不能提交等意图时使用此技能。注意：此技能与「代码评审」不同——代码评审在开发完成后结合需求文档与概要设计进行完整度审查，提交前检查是轻量级的基于 git diff 的代码质量把关。", "downloads": 49, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_377751ac/wenwei-commit-review", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/f7fabcfa-0496-4dc7-9258-df9b7c751850.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "git提交前检查", "ownerName": "user_377751ac", "score": 4707.012487992315, "slug": "wenwei-commit-review", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780496217804, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779557615607, "description": "项目全生命周期管理引擎。用于系统化、流程化地执行软件工程任务。\n\n**When to use**:\n- 用户说\"帮我开发...\"、\"实现...功能\"、\"新增...\"、\"写个...\"\n- 用户说\"帮我分析...\"、\"审查...\"、\"看看这个设计...\"\n- 用户说\"出错了\"、\"报错了\"、\"修个Bug\"、\"修复...\"\n- 用户说\"帮我规划...\"、\"怎么做...\"、\"有什么方案\"\n- 用户说\"完善文档...\"、\"补充文档...\"、\"写文档...\"\n- 用户说\"重构...\"、\"优化架构...\"、\"技术债务...\"\n- 用户说\"测试...\"、\"写测试...\"、\"覆盖率...\"\n- 用户输入 \"/reqplan\" 命令\n- 任何涉及多步骤、需要设计-实现-验证的复杂任务\n\n**When NOT to use**:\n- 单次简单问答（如\"Python列表怎么排序\"），不涉及多步骤任务规划\n- 纯聊天对话，无具体任务目标（无开发/分析/修复意图）\n- 纯粹的信息查询（如\"React 18 新增了什么\"），不需要代码产出\n- 用户仅要求查看/浏览代码，无需分析、修改或设计\n- 需求极度模糊且用户拒绝澄清，无法确定具体任务边界\n- 任务目标/范围已明确固定、只需单次代码修改、不涉及多阶段协作\n\n**How it works**:\n0. 确定项目路径（元任务走兜底规则，不以路径模糊为由跳过）\n1. 读取接力棒（.agent/harness/_baton.md）获取当前状态\n2. 按状态机自动执行：START→ANALYZE→CONFIRM→DESIGN→IMPLEMENT→VERIFY→JUDGE（无需用户逐一下令）\n3. 每个阶段必须验证产物才能进入下一阶段\n4. 所有产物通过文件传递，禁止口头传递\n5. 用户必须在 CONFIRM 阶段确认后才能继续\n6. 每步回复第一行必须输出\"当前状态：[状态名]，下一步：[操作]\"\n7. 每步结束执行验证链检查（计数验证/列表验证/文件验证），防止虚假完成\n\n**What it produces**:\n- 需求分析报告（_analysis.md）\n- 技术设计文档（_design.md）\n- 实现摘要（_implementation.md）\n- 验证报告（_verification.md）\n- 接力棒状态（_baton.md）\n- **质量审核报告（_quality_audit_analysis.md / _quality_audit_design.md / _quality_audit_implement.md / _quality_audit_verify.md / _quality_audit_judge.md）**", "description_zh": "项目全生命周期管理引擎。用于系统化、流程化地执行软件工程任务,从分析需求、功能设计、任务计划、执行开发、审核验收全流程自动跟进，渐进式披露按需加载，非常流畅贴心的软件工程管理skill", "downloads": 49, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_c4926d5a/reqplan-v3", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/c0bd7863-2689-46f1-941c-e45be1317e90.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "ReqPlan-v3", "ownerName": "user_c4926d5a", "score": 7777.777777777778, "slug": "reqplan-v3", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780495918852, "version": "5.1.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779690266780, "description": "资深大厂产品专家 & 架构级 PRD 架构师。用于生成高完整度、面向开发友好的产品需求文档 (PRD)。 当用户提出以下需求时触发：(1) 写 PRD / 产品需求文档 / 需求规格说明书 (2) 评审或优化现有 PRD (3) 将模糊需求转化为结构化 PRD (4) 产品功能规划与方案设计 (5) 需求分析与拆解。 本技能采用槽位填充法、引导追问、显式排他、面向开发友好等核心工作法， 确保输出的 PRD 能完美对齐业务目标，让产研团队（特别是 AI 编程工具/程序员）直接无缝开发。", "description_zh": ">  AI Coding 时代PRD 最佳实践，用于生成高完整度、面向开发友好的产品需求文档 (PRD)。\n  当用户提出以下需求时触发：(1) 写 PRD / 产品需求文档 / 需求规格说明书 (2) 评审或优化现有 PRD\n  (3) 将模糊需求转化为结构化 PRD (4) 产品功能规划与方案设计 (5) 需求分析与拆解。\n  本技能采用槽位填充法、引导追问、显式排他、面向开发友好等核心工作法，确保输出的 PRD 能完美对齐业务目标，让产研团队（特别是 AI 编程工具/程序员）直接无缝开发。", "downloads": 49, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_2eceb40f/prd-expert", "iconUrl": "https://cloudcache.tencent-cloud.com/qcloud/ui/static/other_external_resource/a78375f1-773e-4817-b4f3-0557b6afd777.png", "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "PRD生成", "ownerName": "user_2eceb40f", "score": 27071.82320441989, "slug": "prd-expert", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780495319190, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779162648777, "description": "旋转机械振动健康快速筛查（含鲁棒接入层）。当用户提供任意格式的振动信号文件（CSV/NPY/MAT/WAV/XLSX/Parquet 等），即便采样率、单位、转速未知，也能给出 ISO 20816-3:2022 健康度判定。本 Skill 自带\"接入层\"——自动识别格式、嗅探元数据、单位归一、与用户确认低置信项——再调用核心 ISO 评估算法，输出 A/B/C/D 区 + 健康度评分（0-100）。适用于任意联轴工业旋转设备（电机/泵/风机/压缩机/汽轮机）的点检、巡检、现场快速健康初筛。", "description_zh": "旋转机械振动健康快速筛查（含鲁棒接入层）。当用户提供任意格式的振动信号文件（CSV/NPY/MAT/WAV/XLSX/Parquet 等），即便采样率、单位、转速未知，也能给出 ISO 20816-3:2022 健康度判定。本 Skill 自带\"接入层\"——自动识别格式、嗅探元数据、单位归一、与用户确认低置信项——再调用核心 ISO 评估算法，输出 A/B/C/D 区 + 健康度评分（0-100）。适用于任意联轴工业旋转设备（电机/泵/风机/压缩机/汽轮机）的点检、巡检、现场快速健康初筛。", "downloads": 49, "homepage": "https://api.skillhub.cn/user_09377e9a/vibration-quick-screen", "iconUrl": null, "installs": 0, "labels": {"requires_api_key": "false"}, "name": "机械振动健康快速筛查", "ownerName": "user_09377e9a", "score": 27071.82320441989, "slug": "vibration-quick-screen", "source": "community", "stars": 0, "tags": null, "updated_at": 1780495319085, "version": "1.0.0"}, {"category": "", "created_at": 1779519878798, "description": "写作小能手, a TIELab biomedical manuscript English writing skill backed by a local writing knowledge base of sentence patterns, collocations, source-style examples, and terminology. Use when students ask for 写作小能手 or need biomedical English rewriting, polishing, paragraph drafting, grant rationale/background rewriting, Results, Discussion, Abstract, title, or figure legend support with TIELab-approved wording and calibrated scientific claims. Do not use as the primary workflow for full literature review, evidence synthesis, or citation verification.", "description_zh": "写作小能手, a TIELab biomedical manuscript English writing skill backed by a local writing knowledge base of sentence patterns, collocations, source-style examples, and terminology. Use when students ask for 写作小能手 or need biomedical English rewriting, polishing, paragraph drafting, grant rationale/background rewriting, Results, Discussion, Abstract, title, or figure legend support with TIELab-approved wording and calibrated 